...I turned off all of the lanterns.","turnChangeOut":"rollOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"Okie-dokie.★@Don't need that light gettin' in the way."},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":102801},{"effect":"fadeout","id":102901}],"textClear":1},{"autoTurnLast":0.15,"item":[{"path":"resource/scenario/img/51170_storyselect_kuroe/51170_telescope.png","posX":0,"posY":0,"visible":"appear"}]},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":200,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103501,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"And I got the telescope ready!"},{"chara":[{"id":103501,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"Alexandra","textRight":"Oh, is it the sort of telescope that you can link@to your smartphone to take videos?♪"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"Yes, it is! I've already got my phone connected@to it."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"item":[{"path":"resource/scenario/img/51170_storyselect_kuroe/51170_telescope.png","visible":"hide"}],"nameNarration":"","narration":"[se:7106_telmail]*Jingle ♪*","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21813.jpg","narrationEffect":"in"},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_040.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0,"pos":0}]},{"chara":[{"id":102801}],"nameLeft":"Himena","narrationEffect":"out","textLeft":"Did someone get a message?@Sounded like your phone, Miyurin."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"I forgot to turn off notifications...@I'm glad we weren't in the middle of shooting."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"...Who the heck is texting me?"},{"bgm":"stop","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp